          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The host '%@' is unknown.\n\nFingerprint:\n%@\n\nDo you want to trust this host?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The host '%1$@' is unknown.\n\nFingerprint:\n%2$@\n\nDo you want to trust this host?"
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Verten «%@» er ukjent.\n\nFingeravtrykk:\n%@\n\nVil du stole på denne verten?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The host is reachable, but the SSH handshake or authentication isn't completing. Click **Disconnect**, double-check the username and key/password, and try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The host is reachable, but the SSH handshake or authentication isn't completing. Click **Disconnect**, double-check the username and key/password, and try again."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Verten er tilgjengelig, men SSH-håndtrykket eller autentiseringen fullføres ikke. Klikk på **Koble fra**, kontroller brukernavnet og nøkkelen/passordet en gang til, og prøv igjen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The host key for '%@' has changed since it was last trusted.\n\nNew fingerprint:\n%@\n\nThis can happen if the server was reinstalled or rekeyed — or it could indicate a man-in-the-middle attack. Only trust the new key if you are sure it is legitimate." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The host key for '%1$@' has changed since it was last trusted.\n\nNew fingerprint:\n%2$@\n\nThis can happen if the server was reinstalled or rekeyed — or it could indicate a man-in-the-middle attack. Only trust the new key if you are sure it is legitimate."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vertsnøkkelen for «%@» er endret siden du sist stolte på den.\n\nNytt fingeravtrykk:\n%@\n\nDette kan skje hvis serveren er installert på nytt eller har fått nye nøkler — eller det kan være tegn på et mannen-i-midten-angrep. Stol bare på den nye nøkkelen hvis du er sikker på at den er legitim."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The indicator next to each connection shows: idle, connecting, connected (with live traffic counters), disconnecting, or failed. While connected, the menu bar displays a small SSH indicator with TX/RX dots that blink with traffic." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The indicator next to each connection shows: idle, connecting, connected (with live traffic counters), disconnecting, or failed. While connected, the menu bar displays a small SSH indicator with TX/RX dots that blink with traffic."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Indikatoren ved siden av hver tilkobling viser: inaktiv, kobler til, tilkoblet (med trafikktellere i sanntid), kobler fra eller mislyktes. Når du er tilkoblet, viser menylinjen en liten SSH-indikator med TX/RX-punkter som blinker ved trafikk."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The local port may already be in use, or the remote `host:port` can't be reached from the SSH server. Try a different local port, and confirm the remote service is up." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The local port may already be in use, or the remote `host:port` can't be reached from the SSH server. Try a different local port, and confirm the remote service is up."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Den lokale porten er kanskje allerede i bruk, eller den eksterne `host:port` kan ikke nås fra SSH-serveren. Prøv en annen lokal port, og kontroller at den eksterne tjenesten kjører."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This key appears to be encrypted; enter the passphrase." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This key appears to be encrypted; enter the passphrase."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nøkkelen ser ut til å være kryptert. Skriv inn passfrasen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This OpenSSH key is encrypted with a cipher this app doesn't support (only AES ctr/cbc/gcm; not chacha20-poly1305 or 3des-cbc). Re-encrypt it with `ssh-keygen -p -Z aes256-ctr`, remove the passphrase, or convert it to PKCS#8." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This OpenSSH key is encrypted with a cipher this app doesn't support (only AES ctr/cbc/gcm; not chacha20-poly1305 or 3des-cbc). Re-encrypt it with `ssh-keygen -p -Z aes256-ctr`, remove the passphrase, or convert it to PKCS#8."
          }
        },
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Denne OpenSSH-nøkkelen er kryptert med en krypteringsalgoritme som appen ikke støtter (bare AES ctr/cbc/gcm, ikke chacha20-poly1305 eller 3des-cbc). Krypter den på nytt med `ssh-keygen -p -Z aes256-ctr`, fjern passfrasen eller konverter den til PKCS#8."
          }
        }
      }
    },
